{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2024-06", "window": 2, "start_date": 1717804800, "end_date": 1718495999, "month_true_total": 539, "quota": 9, "returned": 9, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:53:45 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "167451689", "author": {"steamid": "76561198086496684", "personaname": "Vach", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/vachv7/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 3974, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3672, "deck_playtime_at_review": 11, "last_played": 1748313910, "avatar": "b5801d8170ed61115ed71b355dcdfa3fc1352550"}, "language": "english", "review": "RoboQuest deserves all the praise and love it gets. I do recommend this game, but I am hoping that the developers will add some features to really make it a 10/10, instead of what I feel it is right now, which is a \"8.5/10\".\r\n\r\n- There really needs to be a way to select starting weapons. Me and my partner spend way too much time restarting runs if the first skill or weapon we get is nothing we use or has the worst affixes of all time.\r\n- Why am I limited to 4 core Skills per run? Shouldn't it just be random?\r\n- The game is seriously missing a survival mode.\r\n- While melee weapons are cool, I can't fathom using them in Guardian 1+. But maybe I just suck with them.\r\n- Gating progression behind \"speedruns\" is... uh... crappy.", "timestamp_created": 1718491767, "timestamp_updated": 1718491767, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "167449585", "author": {"steamid": "76561198854940903", "personaname": "Squid", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198854940903/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 426, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 344, "last_played": 1718512817, "avatar": "bc3121a98deb180864f206aacb827f6052f461f6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee", "timestamp_created": 1718489168, "timestamp_updated": 1718489168, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "167449561", "author": {"steamid": "76561198414608129", "personaname": "ThatFirey", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thatfirey/", "num_games_owned": 283, "num_reviews": 126, "playtime_forever": 102, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5, "last_played": 1734260595, "avatar": "6a9abe6e614802ae71944433b04127ec9daae9fa"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun roguelike fps. Reminds me of a mix between Borderlands and Gunfire Reborn, a lot of fun weapons to experiment with, all of the classes play interesting and are useful in their own ways, although closer to the end sometimes repeating the same places over and over might feel a bit repetitive, it's still a very fun game", "timestamp_created": 1718489135, "timestamp_updated": 1718489135, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "167449224", "author": {"steamid": "76561198981010490", "personaname": "meowsick", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198981010490/", "num_games_owned": 91, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 3724, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2584, "last_played": 1788302671, "avatar": "32932edd31d0c772ad8e187eef756c01bf19b467"}, "language": "english", "review": "AMAZING!!! BEST shooter roguelike EVER!!!!!", "timestamp_created": 1718488746, "timestamp_updated": 1732749588, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.531782805919647217", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "167448253", "author": {"steamid": "76561199440711174", "personaname": "HipCheckThis", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199440711174/", "num_games_owned": 197, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 3725, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3695, "last_played": 1737168807, "avatar": "fd133ff0c1af43b434765fa55a4bf7cd149e5503"}, "language": "english", "review": "When will Spongeeboob Robo-pants be added? I completed this game and have been waiting for the hyped addition of this character, expect a rusty pickle in your mailbox in T-minus 10 minutes.", "timestamp_created": 1718487655, "timestamp_updated": 1718487655, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "167443318", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024898817", "personaname": "NRGy ⛟", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198024898817/", "num_games_owned": 213, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 2222, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 763, "last_played": 1778808994